  << /ActualText (All products are stored within the Archive\054 organized into four rarity levels\054 represented by a four\055leaf clover icon\056 \n\nEach day at 6 PM\054 four products are randomly surfaced on the homepage\056 The selection is personalized\054 allowing each user to encounter a different set of products\056\n\nProduct availability is structured through time\056 Special series and editions are released within defined time windows\054 while the daily refresh continues to surface a rotating selection\054 including items from limited releases\056)
