  << /ActualText (Customization is a central feature of the SoleLuxe experience\056 \n\nResearch indicates a growing preference among younger audiences for brands that emphasize identity\054 self\055awareness\054 and individuality\056 This shift highlights the importance of enabling personal expression through products and interaction\056 \n\nIn response\054 the project establishes customization as a core UX and product strategy\054 structuring both the system and experience around the ability to mix\054 match\054 and build a personal style\056)
